# Local scratch — batch plans, specs, throwaway scripts, source material, agent notes.
# BOTH repos are PUBLIC, so anything here that isn't the app must be unstageable by accident:
# a single `git add -A` is all it takes to publish it permanently.
# ⚠ ROOT-ANCHORED (leading /) on purpose: an unanchored `_*.md` also swallows real tracked repo
# files like design/icons/_README.md. The scratch all lives at the repo root — keep it that way.
/_*.md
/_*.cjs
/_*.mjs
/_*.js
/*.docx
/skill-observations/
